    "Deletion could not be confirmed. Your local history is kept; some cloud records may already be removed. Retry or contact support through the account-deletion page.": "Penghapusan tidak dapat dikonfirmasi. Riwayat lokalmu tetap tersimpan; sebagian data di cloud mungkin sudah dihapus. Coba lagi atau hubungi dukungan melalui halaman penghapusan akun.",
    "Deletion could not finish. Your local history is kept. Please retry or use the account-deletion page for help.": "Penghapusan tidak dapat diselesaikan. Sejarah lokal Anda disimpan. Silakan coba lagi atau gunakan halaman penghapusan akun untuk mendapatkan bantuan.",
    "Deletion paused. Some cloud records may already be removed. Your account and local history are kept; retry to finish.": "Penghapusan dijeda. Beberapa data cloud mungkin sudah dihapus. Akun dan riwayat lokal Anda disimpan; coba lagi untuk menyelesaikan.",
    "Depth beats breadth here. Solve fewer problems, but understand every step of each one.": "Di sini kedalaman lebih penting daripada keluasan. Kerjakan lebih sedikit soal, tetapi pahami setiap langkahnya.",
