    "Done. Today’s focus plan follows your timetable: {0} in {1} blocks, and your goal ring shows each subject.": "Selesai. Rencana fokus hari ini mengikuti jadwalmu: {0} dalam blok {1}, dan cincin targetmu menampilkan tiap mata pelajaran.",
