    "Two compulsory 3-hour papers on the same day, each covering Physics, Chemistry and Mathematics.": "Dua ujian wajib masing-masing 3 jam pada hari yang sama, keduanya mencakup Fisika, Kimia, dan Matematika.",
    "Two sessions a year. Paper 1 has Physics, Chemistry and Mathematics: 75 questions in 3 hours, for 300 marks.": "Dua sesi setahun. Paper 1 berisi Fisika, Kimia, dan Matematika: 75 soal dalam 3 jam, total 300 poin.",
    "Two written papers, Mathematics (300 marks) and the General Ability Test (600 marks), then an SSB interview.": "Dua ujian tertulis, Matematika (300 poin) dan Tes Kemampuan Umum (600 poin), lalu wawancara SSB.",
