    "120 questions in 2 hours across English, current affairs, legal reasoning, logical reasoning and quantitative techniques.": "120 soalan dalam 2 jam meliputi bahasa Inggeris, isu semasa, penaakulan undang-undang, penaakulan logik dan teknik kuantitatif.",
    "15 min": "15 min",
