    "A budget needs to read how long an app has been open. Use Allow app usage on Home before enabling this rule.": "Belanjawan perlu membaca berapa lama aplikasi telah dibuka. Gunakan Benarkan penggunaan apl di Laman Utama sebelum mendayakan peraturan ini.",
    "A computer-based test. You choose your subjects, and each test has 50 questions in 60 minutes.": "Ujian berasaskan komputer. Anda memilih subjek sendiri, dan setiap ujian ada 50 soalan dalam 60 minit.",
    "A daily allowance, then it closes": "Had harian, kemudian ditutup",
