    "Deletion could not finish. Your local history is kept. Please retry or use the account-deletion page for help.": "Pemadaman tidak dapat diselesaikan. Sejarah tempatan anda disimpan. Sila cuba semula atau gunakan halaman pemadaman akaun untuk mendapatkan bantuan.",
    "Deletion paused. Some cloud records may already be removed. Your account and local history are kept; retry to finish.": "Pemadaman dijeda. Sesetengah rekod awan mungkin sudah dialih keluar. Akaun dan sejarah tempatan anda disimpan; cuba semula untuk selesai.",
    "Depth beats breadth here. Solve fewer problems, but understand every step of each one.": "Di sini kedalaman lebih penting daripada keluasan. Selesaikan lebih sedikit soalan, tetapi fahami setiap langkah.",
