    "That email address does not look right.": "Alamat e-mel itu nampaknya tidak betul.",
    "That screen moved.": "Skrin itu bergerak.",
    "That’s a lot of questions in a minute. Give me a moment, then ask again.": "Banyak soalan dalam seminit. Beri saya sekejap, kemudian tanya semula.",
    "That’s about {0} focus blocks.": "Itu kira-kira {0} blok fokus.",
    "That’s {0} less than this point last month.": "Itu {0} kurang daripada titik yang sama bulan lepas.",
