    "Two compulsory 3-hour papers on the same day, each covering Physics, Chemistry and Mathematics.": "Dua kertas wajib 3 jam pada hari yang sama, setiap satu meliputi Fizik, Kimia dan Matematik.",
    "Two sessions a year. Paper 1 has Physics, Chemistry and Mathematics: 75 questions in 3 hours, for 300 marks.": "Dua sesi setahun. Paper 1 mengandungi Fizik, Kimia dan Matematik: 75 soalan dalam 3 jam, 300 markah.",
    "Two written papers, Mathematics (300 marks) and the General Ability Test (600 marks), then an SSB interview.": "Dua kertas bertulis, Matematik (300 markah) dan Ujian Kebolehan Am (600 markah), kemudian temu duga SSB.",
    "Type the phrase": "Taip frasa",
