    "Run by NTA for undergraduate admission to central universities and many others.": "NTAが実施。中央大学をはじめ多くの大学の学部入学試験です。",
    "Run by UPSC for the IAS, IPS, IFS and other central services.": "UPSCが実施。IAS、IPS、IFSなどの中央公務員の採用試験です。",
    "Run by UPSC twice a year for the Army, Navy and Air Force wings of the National Defence Academy.": "UPSCが年2回実施。国防アカデミーの陸・海・空軍部門の試験です。",
    "Run by one of the IIMs for MBA admission to the IIMs and many other business schools.": "IIMのいずれかが実施。IIMや多くのビジネススクールのMBA入学試験です。",
    "Run by one of the IITs for IIT admission. Only top JEE Main candidates can sit it, with at most two attempts in consecutive years.": "IITのいずれかが、IIT入学のために実施。JEE Mainの上位者のみ受験でき、連続する2年間で最大2回までです。",
    "Run by the Consortium of NLUs for law degrees at the National Law Universities.": "NLUのコンソーシアムが実施。国立法科大学の法学位課程の入学試験です。",
