    "Draw over other apps can show a pause screen, but cannot detect which app is open. Usage Access supplies that detection, so this saved rule stays inactive without it. Open Home and use Allow app usage to read the explanation and choose access. Accessibility is only needed for the YouTube filters.": "在其他应用上绘制可以显示暂停屏幕，但无法检测到哪个应用程序打开。使用 Access 提供该检测，因此如果没有它，此保存的规则将保持非活动状态。打开主页并使用允许应用程序使用来阅读说明并选择访问权限。仅 YouTube 过滤器需要辅助功能。",
    "Draw over other apps is off, so FocusForge cannot show the pause screen over your chosen apps. This rule will stay off.\n\nAllow FocusForge in Android Draw over other apps settings, then return and enable the rule again.": "在其他应用程序上绘制已关闭，因此 FocusForge 无法在您选择的应用程序上显示暂停屏幕。这条规则将被保留。 \n \n 允许 Android Draw 中的 FocusForge 覆盖其他应用程序设置，然后返回并再次启用该规则。",
