    "Shield needs a couple of permissions before locks work.": "屏蔽需要几项权限，锁定才能生效。",
    "Shield needs usage access to see which app is open. Your rule is saved and starts working once you allow it from Home.": "Shield 需要使用情况访问权限才能知道哪个应用已打开。你的规则已保存，在 Home 中允许后即开始生效。",
    "Shield status. {0}.{1}": "屏蔽状态。 {0}.{1}",
    "Shield uses this only to close YouTube Shorts and the home feed.": "Shield 只用它来关闭 YouTube Shorts 和首页推荐。",
    "Shield uses this to see which app is open and how long you used it today.": "Shield 用它查看哪个应用已打开，以及你今天用了多久。",
    "Shield uses this to show its pause screen over the apps you block.": "Shield 用它在你拦截的应用上层显示暂停画面。",
    "Short break": "短断",
    "Short daily blocks beat one long cram session — your memory consolidates between sessions, not during them.": "每天的短时间块胜过一次长时间的补习班——你的记忆会在课程之间而不是课程期间得到巩固。",
    "Shorts and feeds closed": "短路和馈电关闭",
    "Shorts are paused. Keep your focus.": "短裤已暂停。保持专注。",
    "Shorts are recognised by the names YouTube gives its own screens, not by reading what is on them. A future YouTube update can rename them, and the block would stop firing until FocusForge is updated to match.": "Shorts 短片是通过 YouTube 为自己的屏幕指定的名称来识别的，而不是通过阅读屏幕上的内容来识别。未来的 YouTube 更新可以重命名它们，并且该块将停止触发，直到 FocusForge 更新为匹配。",
    "Shorts are recognised by the names YouTube gives its own screens. Study channel filtering reads only visible creator labels on supported video pages and compares them on this device. It does not classify every video as educational. A YouTube layout update can affect recognition; full-screen pages may hide the creator.": "Shorts 识别依据的是 YouTube 为其页面使用的名称。学习频道筛选仅读取支持的视频页面上可见的创作者标签，并在本设备上进行比对，不会判断每个视频是否具有教育性。YouTube 页面布局更新可能影响识别；全屏页面可能会隐藏创作者信息。",
