    "Up to 32 members per group. Members see your name, weekly totals and focus status. Weeks reset on Monday at 00:00 UTC. Leaving removes your row.": "每组最多 32 名成员。成员可以看到您的姓名、每周总计和焦点状态。周数于星期一 00:00 UTC 重置。离开会删除您的行。",
    "Usage Access is on": "使用访问已开启",
    "Usage Access lets FocusForge read which app is open and how long apps are used. We use this on your device to show screen-time totals and enforce the app boundaries and daily budgets you choose.\n\nThis data stays on this device and is not uploaded. It does not let us read messages, typed text or browsing content. Access is optional: your focus timer and study history work without it. You can revoke it in Android Settings at any time.\n\nContinue to Android Usage Access settings, select FocusForge and decide whether to allow it.": "使用访问可让 FocusForge 读取哪个应用程序处于打开状态以及应用程序的使用时长。我们在您的设备上使用此功能来显示屏幕总时间并强制执行您选择的应用边界和每日预算。 \n \n 此数据保留在此设备上且不会上传。它不允许我们阅读消息、键入文本或浏览内容。访问是可选的：您的焦点计时器和研究历史无需它即可工作。您可以随时在 Android 设置中撤销它。 \n \n 继续Android使用访问设置，选择FocusForge并决定是否允许。",
    "Usage access": "使用情况访问权限",
    "Usage access is off, so FocusForge cannot detect when your chosen apps are open or measure their daily budgets. This rule will stay off.\n\nAllow FocusForge in Android Usage access settings, then return and enable the rule again. Usage history stays on this device.": "使用访问权限已关闭，因此 FocusForge 无法检测您选择的应用程序何时打开或衡量其每日预算。这条规则将被保留。 \n \n 在 Android 使用访问设置中允许 FocusForge，然后返回并再次启用该规则。使用历史记录保留在此设备上。",
    "Usage access is off, so today's screen time cannot be read. Grant it from the Apps tab to see real numbers here.": "使用访问已关闭，因此无法读取今天的屏幕时间。从“应用程序”选项卡授予它，以在此处查看真实数字。",
